    [IsScalarTower K₀ K BdR] [IsScalarTower Qp K₀ BdR]
    (PD : PeriodData G Qp K₀ K B BdR) {LL O : Type} [Field LL] [Algebra Qp LL] [TopologicalSpace LL]
